content": "Speaking"}], "type": "learning_skills"}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Instructions: Complete the following steps. Fill in the Self Assessment."}], "type": "post_instructions"}]}], "type": "scholar", "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "has_nav", "content": true}, {"type": "has_exercise_controls", "content": true}], "type": "lab_options"}], "id": 0, "stimuli": [{"contents": [{}], "type": "welcome", "_data": [], "id": 0, "template_override": 1}, {"contents": [{"type": "video", "value": {"images": [{"time": "0", "text": "", "id": 0, "image": ""}, {"time": "100", "text": "Healthy eating is very important. This is the topic of many articles and conversations, so it must be difficult for many people. Don't get schooled about eating your vegetables! Think about planning a healthy diet as a number of small, manageable steps you follow at school or work.", "id": 1, "image": ""}, {"time": "16500", "text": "Prepare more of your own meals and follow a schedule.  When cutting back on unhealthy foods in your diet, replace them with healthy alternatives. Replacing animal fats with vegetable fats (for example, switching butter for olive oil) will be beneficial to your health.  I speculate that eating healthy <span class=\"italic\">must</span> make a difference in how you feel.", "id": 2, "image": ""}, {"time": "37250", "text": "<p>Instead of counting calories, think of your diet in terms of color, variety, and freshness. Do you avoid packaged and processed foods and opt for more fresh ingredients?</p><p>Read the labels. It's important to be aware of what's in your food. Many packaged foods claim to be healthy, but they must have large amounts of sugar and salt.</p>", "id": 3, "image": ""}, {"time": "58000", "text": "<p>Focus on how you feel after eating. Don't you think that the more you eat healthy food, the better you'll feel after a meal? The more junk food you eat, the more likely you are to feel uncomfortable, nauseous, or drained of energy. </p><p>Follow these tips and you will create your own schema of healthy eating.</p>", "id": 4, "image": ""}], "video_src": "engenn7le07ob04re2vid01"}}], "id": 5, "template_override": 1, "type": "video", "title": "", "_data": []}]}]}